  ProjectName: Party Golf
  ClientName: Hivolve
  Tags: 96
  Texts:
  - category: 0
    info: Unity Developer (internship project)
  - category: 1
    info: hivolve developed XR (VR/AR/MR) experiences for businesses in Europe and
      America, working with HR, sales and marketing teams at well-known private companies
      and public entities. (The company is no longer active.)
  - category: 2
    info: 'A party-themed mobile mini-golf game I built during my internship at hivolve,
      inspired by Golf It. It has level select, local multiplayer and an in-game
      shop.

      

'
  - category: 9
    info: '- Ball physics: tuned the golf ball physics to feel right on a phone.

      -
      Touch controls: designed aiming and shooting for touchscreens.

      - Monetization:
      integrated mobile ads.

      - Optimization: my first pass at optimizing
      a game for mobile hardware.


      As my first mobile game, it set the foundation
      for the mobile input, physics, ads and optimization work in my later projects.'
